<main id="app-shell" data-page="home">
  <div class="experience-canvas">
    <div class="film-plane" aria-hidden="false">
      <video class="film-plane__video" data-film controls muted playsinline preload="auto" fetchpriority="high" poster="{{ basePath }}/media/spa-film-60fps-poster.jpg">
        <source src="{{ basePath }}/media/spa-film-60fps-all-intra.mp4" type="video/mp4">
      </video>
      <div class="film-plane__veil" aria-hidden="true"></div>
      <div class="film-progress" aria-hidden="true"><span data-film-progress></span></div>
    </div>

    <section id="main-content" class="film-journey" data-scroll-film tabindex="-1">
    <article class="journey-copy">
      <header class="hero chapter-panel chapter-panel--hero">
        <p class="material-line">A continuous treatment concept</p>
        <h1>Enter the quiet between moments.</h1>
        <p class="hero__lede">A warmed towel. Botanical oil. Vapor, stone, and one undisturbed mineral pool. “The Exhale” turns the physical passage into a resort-spa experience.</p>
        <a class="text-link" href="#inquiry">Request a private walkthrough</a>
      </header>

      {% for chapter in chapters %}
      <section class="chapter-panel chapter-panel--{{ chapter.slug }}" id="{{ chapter.slug }}" data-film-chapter="{{ chapter.slug }}">
        <div class="chapter-panel__copy">
          <p class="material-line">{{ chapter.material }}</p>
          <h2>{{ chapter.shortTitle }}</h2>
          <p>{{ chapter.summary }}</p>
          {% if staticMode %}
          <a href="{{ basePath }}/chapters/{{ chapter.slug }}/">Read the material note</a>
          {% else %}
          <a href="/fragments/chapter/{{ chapter.slug }}" hx-get="/fragments/chapter/{{ chapter.slug }}" hx-target="#chapter-detail-{{ chapter.slug }}" hx-swap="innerHTML">Read the material note</a>
          {% endif %}
          <div id="chapter-detail-{{ chapter.slug }}" class="chapter-inline-detail" aria-live="polite"></div>
        </div>
      </section>
      {% endfor %}
    </article>
    </section>

    <section class="return" aria-labelledby="return-title">
    <div class="return__statement">
      <h2 id="return-title">Stillness, made tangible.</h2>
      <p>The sequence closes where the commercial experience begins: a calm treatment room, a clear material language, and a guest ritual a resort team can evaluate through touch, pacing, and atmosphere.</p>
    </div>
    <dl class="treatment-flow">
      <div><dt>Arrival</dt><dd>Woven heat and condensation establish care at the smallest scale.</dd></div>
      <div><dt>Release</dt><dd>Oil and vapor extend touch into breath, scent, and space.</dd></div>
      <div><dt>Immersion</dt><dd>Mineral water resolves the journey through one measured ripple.</dd></div>
    </dl>
    </section>

    <section class="guided-tour" data-guided-tour aria-labelledby="tour-title">
    <div>
      <h2 id="tour-title">Replay at the film’s pace.</h2>
    </div>
    <div class="guided-tour__controls">
      <button type="button" class="tour-button" data-tour-action="play" aria-pressed="false">Play from start</button>
      <button type="button" class="tour-button" data-tour-action="pause">Pause</button>
      <button type="button" class="tour-button is-active" data-tour-speed="1" aria-pressed="true">1× · 20s</button>
      <button type="button" class="tour-button" data-tour-speed="2" aria-pressed="false">2× · 10s</button>
    </div>
    <p class="guided-tour__status" data-tour-status role="status" aria-live="polite">Ready for a 20-second guided descent.</p>
    </section>

    <section id="inquiry" class="inquiry" aria-labelledby="inquiry-title">
    <div class="inquiry__intro">
      <h2 id="inquiry-title">Shape a signature treatment journey.</h2>
      <p>Explore how warmth, touch, vapor, and water could become an ownable guest ritual for your property. Share the property or group you represent to request a private walkthrough.</p>
      {% if staticMode %}
      <p class="inquiry__disclosure">This public Pages edition presents the complete concept without transmitting inquiry data.</p>
      {% else %}
      <p class="inquiry__disclosure">This demonstration validates the request on the server and confirms it here; external delivery is not connected.</p>
      {% endif %}
    </div>
    {% include "fragments/inquiry-form.njk" %}
    </section>

    <footer class="site-close">
      <p>The Exhale</p>
      <p>Warmth · touch · vapor · water · return</p>
      <a href="{{ basePath }}/prompt/">Read the reconstruction archive</a>
    </footer>
  </div>
</main>
